Feature: Demoblaze E-commerce Automation

  Scenario: User Signup
    Given user is on home page
    When user clicks signup
    And user enters username "test123"
    And user enters password "test123"
    And user clicks signup button
    Then user should see signup success alert

  Scenario: User Login
    Given user is on home page
    When user clicks login
    And user enters username "test123"
    And user enters password "test123"
    And user clicks login button
    Then user should be logged in

  Scenario: Add product to cart
    Given user is logged in
    When user selects product "Samsung galaxy s6"
    And user clicks add to cart
    Then product should be added to cart

  Scenario: Place order
    Given user is on cart page
    When user clicks place order
    And user enters order details
    And user confirms purchase
    Then order should be successful

  Scenario: Logout
    Given user is logged in
    When user clicks logout
    Then user should be logged out
